import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="How we make money"
	description="How affiliate links support this site, how we choose what to recommend, and important disclaimers."
	pubDate={new Date('June 4 2026')}
>
	<p>
		This site is free to read because we use affiliate links. When you sign up for a platform through
		one of our links, we may earn a commission from that company. You do not pay extra — the price,
		fees, and offers you see on the platform are the same as if you had gone there directly.
	</p>

	<p>
		Commissions help cover the time it takes to research, write, and update guides and comparisons.
		That is what keeps the content free instead of behind a paywall or full of intrusive ads.
	</p>

	<p>
		We only recommend platforms we believe are genuinely useful for the readers we write for. A higher
		payout does not automatically mean a better review or a top spot on our comparison page. If a
		platform is a poor fit for beginners, restricted in your country, or hard to use, we say so — even
		when we have an affiliate relationship with it.
	</p>

	<p>
		<strong>Trade responsibly.</strong> Prediction markets involve real money and real risk. Prices move,
		rules vary by platform and jurisdiction, and you can lose what you put in. Never trade with money you
		need for essentials, and take time to understand how each platform works before depositing.
	</p>

	<p>
		<strong>Educational content only.</strong> Everything on this site is for learning and comparison. It
		is not financial, legal, or tax advice, and it is not a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any
		contract or asset. Check each platform’s terms and your local laws before signing up.
	</p>
</Layout>
